# Fluffy & Moist Coconut Cake

Based on [Sally’s Baking Addiction](https://sallysbakingaddiction.com/coconut-cake/)

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

### Cake

- [ ] 2.5 cups (285g) [cake flour]{ ing="cake-flour" }, spooned & leveled
- [ ] 2 tsp [baking powder]{ ing="baking-powder" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [baking soda]{ ing="baking-soda" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] 3/4 cup (12 Tbsp; 170g) [unsalted butter]{ ing="unsalted-butter" }, softened
- [ ] 1.67 cups (330g) [granulated sugar]{ ing="granulated-sugar" }
- [ ] 5 large [egg whites]{ ing="egg-whites" }, room temperature
- [ ] 1/2 cup (120g) [sour cream]{ ing="sour-cream" }, room temperature
- [ ] 2 tsp [pure vanilla extract]{ ing="pure-vanilla-extract" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [coconut extract]{ ing="coconut-extract" }
- [ ] 1 cup (226g/240ml) [unsweetened canned coconut milk]{ ing="unsweetened-canned-coconut-milk" }, room temperature
- [ ] 1 cup (80g) [sweetened shredded coconut]{ ing="sweetened-shredded-coconut" }

### Frosting

- [ ] 1 cup (16 Tbsp; 226g) [unsalted butter]{ ing="unsalted-butter" }, softened
- [ ] 8 ounces (226g) [full-fat brick cream cheese]{ ing="full-fat-brick-cream-cheese" }, softened
- [ ] 5 cups (600g) [confectioners’ sugar]{ ing="confectioners-sugar" }
- [ ] 2 Tbsps (30ml) [canned coconut milk]{ ing="canned-coconut-milk" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [pure vanilla extract]{ ing="pure-vanilla-extract" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [coconut extract]{ ing="coconut-extract" }
- [ ] 1/8 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] 2 cups (160g) [sweetened shredded coconut]{ ing="sweetened-shredded-coconut" }

## Recipe

1. Preheat oven to 350°F. Grease three 8-inch cake pans, line with parchment paper, then grease the parchment.
1. Whisk together [cake flour]{ ing="cake-flour" }, [baking powder]{ ing="baking-powder" }, [baking soda]{ ing="baking-soda" }, and [salt]{ ing="salt" }; set aside.
1. Beat [butter]{ ing="unsalted-butter" } and [sugar]{ ing="confectioners-sugar" } until creamy (about 2 minutes). Add [egg whites]{ ing="egg-whites" }, [sour cream]{ ing="sour-cream" }, vanilla, and [coconut extract]{ ing="coconut-extract" }. Gradually mix in dry ingredients and [coconut milk]{ ing="canned-coconut-milk" } on low speed, then add [shredded coconut]{ ing="sweetened-shredded-coconut" }.
1. Divide batter evenly among pans. Bake 21-24 minutes until a toothpick inserted in the center comes out clean. Cool in pans for 1 hour, then transfer to racks to cool completely.
1. Beat [butter]{ ing="unsalted-butter" } and [cream cheese]{ ing="full-fat-brick-cream-cheese" } until smooth. Add [confectioners’ sugar]{ ing="confectioners-sugar" }, [coconut milk]{ ing="canned-coconut-milk" }, vanilla, [coconut extract]{ ing="coconut-extract" }, and [salt]{ ing="salt" }. Beat on high for 3 minutes.
1. Level cake tops. Layer cakes with frosting between each layer (approximately 1 heaping cup per layer). Frost exterior and apply [shredded coconut]{ ing="sweetened-shredded-coconut" } to top and sides.
1. Refrigerate at least 20 minutes before slicing.

## Notes

- Store covered in refrigerator up to 5 days.
